@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

box "Afsenderside" #F4F8FB
    actor "Afsender EUA" as Sender
    participant "Afsender AP / VANS" as SenderGW
end box

participant "EER\n(FHIR Endpoint Register)" as EER

box "Modtagerside (GLN: 5790001234567)" #F9F5FA
    participant "Modtager AP / VANS\n(Modtager-gateway)" as ReceiverGW
    participant "Modtager Mapningskomponent" as Map
    actor "Modtager EUA\n(Fagsystem)" as Receiver
end box

== 1. Afsenderside: Opslag på offentlig kapabilitet ==
Sender -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=gs1.org/gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> Sender : Public Endpoint\n(Accepterer FHIR CareCommunication)
deactivate EER

Sender -> SenderGW : Afsend FHIR-meddelelse
activate SenderGW
SenderGW -> ReceiverGW : Transporterer FHIR-meddelelse til GLN 5790001234567
deactivate SenderGW
activate ReceiverGW

== 2. Modtagerside: Opslag på reel EUA-kapabilitet ==
note right of ReceiverGW
  Modtagersiden skal nu finde ud af,
  hvilket format den lokale EUA reelt forstår
end note
ReceiverGW -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=eua-gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> ReceiverGW : EUA Target Endpoint\n(Kräver OIOXML DIS91 via lokal postkasse)
deactivate EER

== 3. Modtagerside: Lokal mapning og aflevering ==
ReceiverGW -> Map : Konverter indkommende FHIR -> OIOXML DIS91
deactivate ReceiverGW
activate Map
Map -> Receiver : Afleverer OIOXML i EUA'ens format
deactivate Map
activate Receiver

== 4. Kvitteringsflow tilbage gennem modtagersidens mapning ==
Receiver --> Map : Returnerer OIOXML kvittering (CTL)
deactivate Receiver
activate Map
Map -> ReceiverGW : Konverterer OIOXML CTL -> FHIR Acknowledgement
deactivate Map
activate ReceiverGW
ReceiverGW --> SenderGW : Sender FHIR kvittering retur
deactivate ReceiverGW
activate SenderGW
SenderGW --> Sender : Modtager FHIR kvittering
deactivate SenderGW

@enduml
